@startuml TBOT-ParentGate
title Domain · parent-gate — explicit PIN compatibility + Robot activation reference
left to right direction

actor Child
actor Parent

package "parent-gate" <<service>> {
  usecase "Authenticate Parent PIN" as UC_PG_PASS
  usecase "Activate Robot\n(6-character code)" as UC_PG_UNLOCK
}

Child  --> UC_PG_PASS    : initiate
Parent --> UC_PG_PASS    : complete
Parent --> UC_PG_UNLOCK

note bottom of UC_PG_PASS
  ParentGateScreen calls authenticateParent only when
  navigation explicitly opens this compatibility route.
  useParentGateGuard is a no-op, so parent screens can
  currently open without passing through this use case.
end note

note bottom of UC_PG_UNLOCK
  Purchase ActivateScreen collects six characters,
  uppercases them, and calls activateRobot(code).
  This is not a Parent PIN or course-assignment gate.
end note

' Files:
'   src/features/parent/screens/ParentGateScreen.tsx
'   src/features/purchase/screens/ActivateScreen.tsx
@enduml
